{"channelId":"UC1ddMYkdv6B07m_vgs_ND_w","row":["Atrium Health Floyd",1720,"We are proud to be a part of Advocate Health, headquartered in Charlotte, and the fifth-largest nonprofit health system, serving nearly 6 million patients across six states.  \n\nAtrium Health Floyd provides a full spectrum of health care services from prenatal childbirth classes to grief support groups through Heyman Hospice Care at Floyd. More than 2,000 babies are born at Atrium Health Floyd Medical Center each year and are cared for in one of our three nurseries, including a neonatal intensive care nursery for babies as small as two pounds. \n\nPeople are at the center of everything we do. We are committed to our patients, our co-workers and our community, and we are committed to exceeding your expectations.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1ddMYkdv6B07m_vgs_ND_w","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1ddMYkdv6B07m_vgs_ND_w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:09.810Z","channelId":"UC1ddMYkdv6B07m_vgs_ND_w","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"31e29f594ff04e040ccba917f6cbea238f4c2a8c5c9e071d4f6915b538ee7920","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"37e2e113922731bc4eafa676587e8417c8f70f209236076caab27f583373dff5"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1ddMYkdv6B07m_vgs_ND_w","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1720,"raw":"1.72K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1ddMYkdv6B07m_vgs_ND_w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:09.810Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"